msgid ""
"Our invoices are payable within 21 working days, unless another payment "
"timeframe is indicated on either the invoice or the order. In the event of "
"non-payment by the due date, My US Company reserves the right to request a "
"fixed interest payment amounting to 10% of the sum remaining due. My US "
"Company will be authorized to suspend any provision of services without "
"prior warning in the event of late payment."
msgstr ""
"Nuestras facturas se pagan dentro de un plazo de 21 días hábiles, salvo que "
"la factura o la orden indiquen otro plazo de pago. En caso de falta de pago "
"en la fecha límite, la empresa US se reserva el derecho de exigir un interés "
"fijo equivalente al 10% del importe pendiente. La empresa US puede suspender "
"la prestación de servicios sin previo aviso en caso de pago atrasado."

